@startuml
title 设置、Provider 配置与 Secrets 边界

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User

package "Renderer" {
  [Settings Page]
  [Provider Status View]
}

package "Preload API" {
  [window.api.system]
}

package "Electron Main" {
  [Settings Handler]
  [Config Store]
  [Secrets Store Adapter]
  [Provider Health Checker]
}

database "App SQLite" as DB
folder "Secrets Store" as Secrets

User --> [Settings Page] : 输入 Provider 配置
[Settings Page] --> [window.api.system] : saveProviderConfig()
[window.api.system] --> [Settings Handler]
[Settings Handler] --> [Config Store] : 保存非敏感字段
[Config Store] --> DB
[Settings Handler] --> [Secrets Store Adapter] : 保存 API Key / Token
[Secrets Store Adapter] --> Secrets

[Provider Status View] --> [window.api.system] : getProviderStatus()
[window.api.system] --> [Provider Health Checker]
[Provider Health Checker] --> [Config Store]
[Provider Health Checker] --> [Secrets Store Adapter]
[Provider Health Checker] --> [Provider Status View] : configured / available / maskedKey

note bottom
Renderer 只看到脱敏状态。
完整 API Key 和 Token 不返回 Renderer。
end note

@enduml
